# Industry Research

# Research Item 1201

Source Type:
Industry Research

Source:
NNG

Topic:
Explainable AI

Observation:
Users increasingly rely on AI outputs to make decisions. Explanations help users understand outputs, calibrate trust, and determine whether an AI response should be trusted.

Translation to License Management:

When AI explains:

- Why a license is expiring
- Why a user cannot access a product
- Why a recommendation was made

users make better decisions.

Key Takeaway:

AI should explain recommendations and actions rather than only providing answers.

Confidence:
High

Sources:
https://www.nngroup.com/articles/explainable-ai/

---

# Research Item 1202

Source Type:
Industry Research

Source:
NNG

Topic:
Chatbot Limitations

Observation:
Chatbots perform best when helping users complete focused tasks and often struggle when conversations become complex or highly procedural.

Translation to License Management:

Simple tasks:

- Find license
- Check expiration
- Explain seat usage

Complex tasks:

- Bulk assignments
- Renewal management
- License audits

should move beyond chat interaction.

Key Takeaway:

Complex administrative workflows should transition from conversation into structured experiences.

Confidence:
High

Sources:
https://www.nngroup.com/articles/chatbots/

