# Research Item 1305

Source Type:
Expert Pattern

Source:
Enterprise AI UX

Topic:
Confidence and Uncertainty

Observation:
AI responses can appear authoritative even when uncertainty exists.

Examples:

Instead of:

"Sarah cannot access VMware."

Provide:

"Sarah may not have an assigned seat. Based on current account information, this appears to be the most likely cause."

Key Takeaway:

AI should communicate uncertainty when confidence is low.

Confidence:
High

